LICENSE
README.md
    1→# mdBook
    7→mdBook is a utility to create modern online books from Markdown files.
    9→Check out the **[User Guide]** for a list of features and installation and usage information.
    10→The User Guide also serves as a demonstration to showcase what a book looks like.
    12→If you are interested in contributing to the development of mdBook, check out the [Contribution Guide].
    14→## License
    16→All the code in this repository is released under the ***Mozilla Public License v2.0***, for more information take a look at the [LICENSE] file.
    18→[User Guide]: https://rust-lang.github.io/mdBook/
    19→[contribution guide]: https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md
    20→[LICENSE]: https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook/blob/master/LICENSE
